  "notes": [
    "Reset is the controller's setOpBorrowing: ControllerV1.repayBorrowAllowed lets only openLev or opBorrowing repay with isEnd, so before slot 0x1b pointed at OPBorrowing its repayBorrowEndByOpenLev call reverted. Later OPBorrowing market-conf edits lowered fees and liquidity caps, which the exploit did not need.",
    "No OPBorrowing liquidation wrote off LPool debt (RepayBorrow bad debt > 0) before the anchor. The campaign is the attacker's further wipe/payoff cycles on BSC and the same run against OpenLeverage's Arbitrum deployment (OPBorrowing 0xe7779ebb); its no-transfer and failed txs are left out.",
    "Loss is the debt the wipes wrote off: the LPools' net outflow per tx (OpenLeverage LPools whose controller is 0x912c0462 on BSC, 0xabb0abfa on Arbitrum), i.e. the margin and OPBorrowing loans never repaid."
